{
  "locale": "zh-Hans",
  "phrases": [
    { "id": "computer.001", "text": "又一个十五分钟编译成功了。你的项目可不一定。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.002", "text": "你的编译器向你问好。主要是警告。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.003", "text": "时间在飞。你的构建系统更喜欢走路。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.004", "text": "某个地方，一个分号正在毁掉别人的下午。", "category": "computer", "tone": "polite", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.005", "text": "你开了十七个标签页，却一个答案也没有。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.006", "text": "这个 bug 已经晋升为功能了。恭喜。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.007", "text": "你的 CPU 相信你。你的内存有些疑虑。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.008", "text": "天气真好，适合清一下缓存然后假装有用。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.009", "text": "代码能跑。请什么都别碰。", "category": "computer", "tone": "polite", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.010", "text": "你试过把期望关掉再打开吗？", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.011", "text": "最后一个警告，是不能随手修好的。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.012", "text": "你的待办清单申请了它自己的待办清单。", "category": "computer", "tone": "unhinged", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.013", "text": "文档在平行宇宙里是准确的。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.014", "text": "又一个小时，又一个神秘依赖。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.015", "text": "一次干净的构建，既美好又可疑。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.016", "text": "你的终端见过一些再也忘不掉的东西。", "category": "computer", "tone": "unhinged", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.017", "text": "今日预报：零星异常，可能有回滚。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.018", "text": "你可以关掉一个标签页。就当奖励。", "category": "computer", "tone": "polite", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.019", "text": "调试器没有在评判你。大概吧。", "category": "computer", "tone": "polite", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.020", "text": "未来的你已经就这个快捷方式提出了投诉。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.021", "text": "Git 记得。Git 永远记得。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.022", "text": "这个仓库里某处有个叫 final_final 的函数。", "category": "computer", "tone": "polite", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.023", "text": "测试全绿。绿得可疑。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.024", "text": "你的笔记本风扇正在创作实验爵士。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },
    { "id": "computer.025", "text": "你考虑过少写点配置文件吗？我们也没有。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 4 },

    { "id": "break.026", "text": "你已经在这儿三个小时了。外面的世界想聊两句。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "minActiveMinutes": 180 },
    { "id": "break.027", "text": "你的椅子已经受够你的陪伴了。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.028", "text": "天空依然免费开放，无需订阅。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.029", "text": "去看看一棵树吧。不需要调试器。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.030", "text": "你的眼睛申请了一个维护窗口。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.031", "text": "散个短步，也许能解决脑子里的依赖。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.032", "text": "草没有更新，但仍然值得摸一摸。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.033", "text": "水：最原始的生产力插件。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.034", "text": "伸个懒腰。连你的栈都有极限。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.035", "text": "你可以让电脑独处一会儿。它应付得来。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.036", "text": "咖啡不能代替日光。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.037", "text": "友情提醒：膝盖是有用途的。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.038", "text": "离屏幕远一点。像素会保持忠诚。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.039", "text": "新鲜空气的向后兼容性极好。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.040", "text": "你的键盘建议短暂分离。", "category": "break", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },

    { "id": "morning.041", "text": "早上好。bug 已经醒了好几个小时。", "category": "morning", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "morning" },
    { "id": "morning.042", "text": "起床发光吧。或者起床谈判。", "category": "morning", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "morning" },
    { "id": "morning.043", "text": "早餐不是可选依赖。", "category": "morning", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "morning" },
    { "id": "morning.044", "text": "一天还年轻。你的收件箱已经很古老了。", "category": "morning", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "morning" },
    { "id": "morning.045", "text": "咖啡加入了对话。", "category": "morning", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "morning" },

    { "id": "afternoon.046", "text": "快到午饭时间了。连时钟看起来都饿了。", "category": "afternoon", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "afternoon" },
    { "id": "afternoon.047", "text": "下午到了，没有附带任何有用的发行说明。", "category": "afternoon", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "afternoon" },
    { "id": "afternoon.048", "text": "又一个搬窗口搬到很有成就感的上午。", "category": "afternoon", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "afternoon" },
    { "id": "afternoon.049", "text": "日历说开会。灵魂说绝对不行。", "category": "afternoon", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "afternoon" },
    { "id": "afternoon.050", "text": "太阳已经很努力了。你也可以加入它。", "category": "afternoon", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "afternoon" },

    { "id": "evening.051", "text": "晚班现在由一只时钟监督。", "category": "evening", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "evening" },
    { "id": "evening.052", "text": "又一个英勇进展与可疑决定并存的日子。", "category": "evening", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "evening" },
    { "id": "evening.053", "text": "夜深了。未来的你会感谢现在的睡眠。", "category": "evening", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "evening" },

    { "id": "late-night.054", "text": "月亮来打卡了。你打卡下班了吗？", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.055", "text": "午夜：每个想法听起来都像创业公司。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.056", "text": "你的枕头提交了支持工单。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.057", "text": "这个时辰，变量名都变成了诗。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.058", "text": "夜里很安静。除了你的散热风扇。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.059", "text": "代码可以等到早上。bug 哪儿也不会去。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },
    { "id": "late-night.060", "text": "明天又是把所有东西改名的一次机会。", "category": "late-night", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3, "timeWindow": "late-night" },

    { "id": "fortune.061", "text": "盯着看的进度条从不认输。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.062", "text": "小心时钟的智慧：它们总在盘算着什么。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.063", "text": "聪明的程序员知道何时停手。传奇的程序员有计时器。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.064", "text": "时间就是金钱，但这只时钟两样都不收。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.065", "text": "宇宙在膨胀。你的下载文件夹也是。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.066", "text": "别跟时钟争。它拥有全世界的时间。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.067", "text": "如果生活给你柠檬，先检查一下压缩包的校验和。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.068", "text": "你的命运正在处理中。请不要刷新。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.069", "text": "收件箱空空，是讲给初级开发者的神话。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.070", "text": "幸福的秘诀在“设置 → 高级”里的某个地方。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.071", "text": "每一项伟大发明，都始于某个人在躲另一件事。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "polite", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.072", "text": "有两种人：做备份的，和未来的反面教材。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.073", "text": "聪明人提问。愚蠢的人点“全部更新”。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.074", "text": "时钟知道你去年夏天做了什么。大概是在调试。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.075", "text": "某个地方，一台老服务器依然运行完美。没人知道为什么。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },

    { "id": "rare.076", "text": "注意。你的鼠标被选为项目经理了。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.077", "text": "此播报已获国际分钟委员会批准。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.078", "text": "时钟决定转行去跳即兴舞。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.079", "text": "请保持冷静。一个格外准时的秒正在接近。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.080", "text": "下一分钟由上一分钟赞助。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.081", "text": "我数过每一秒。其中一些非常令人失望。", "category": "rare", "tone": "unhinged", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.082", "text": "你的桌子要求做绩效评估。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.083", "text": "时针和分针已经互不说话了。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.084", "text": "我本想讲个时间旅行的笑话，可你不喜欢。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.085", "text": "一个小型时钟委员会投票决定推迟星期二。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.086", "text": "秒们正在组建工会。预计会有延迟。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.087", "text": "你解锁了传奇成就：还坐在这儿。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.088", "text": "很遗憾地通知你，明天没有取消。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.089", "text": "“准时”这个概念目前还在测试版。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },
    { "id": "rare.090", "text": "时钟感谢你继续存在。", "category": "rare", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 1 },

    { "id": "computer.091", "text": "你盯着屏幕的时间，足够变成一张壁纸了。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.092", "text": "又十五分钟，假装这是最后一次修改。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.093", "text": "你的生产力曲线被一个耸肩取代了。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.094", "text": "这是时钟，不是人生教练。不过话说回来。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.095", "text": "你获准停止优化没人会注意的东西。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "fortune.096", "text": "也许 bug 不在代码里。也许 bug 就是命运。", "category": "fortune", "tone": "unhinged", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "break.097", "text": "你的绝妙计划似乎需要更多咖啡。", "category": "break", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.098", "text": "你试过向一只有管理经验的橡皮鸭解释问题吗？", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.099", "text": "再重构一次，项目可能就会产生自我意识。", "category": "computer", "tone": "unhinged", "weight": 3 },
    { "id": "computer.100", "text": "现在该想想，你是不是真的需要又一个功能。", "category": "computer", "tone": "cheeky", "weight": 3 }
  ]
}
